{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1443","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1443/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1443/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1443/events","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1443","id":148303854,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxNDgzMDM4NTQ=","number":1443,"title":"ExoPlayer is not sending STATE_FINISHED on some devices","user":{"login":"DavidMihola","id":594955,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NDk1NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/594955?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola","html_url":"https://github.com/DavidMihola","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidMihola/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":214717009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMTQ3MTcwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/labels/need%20more%20info","name":"need more info","color":"5319e7","default":false,"description":null},{"id":258839460,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNTg4Mzk0NjA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/labels/bug:%20device%20specific","name":"bug: device specific","color":"fbca04","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2016-04-14T09:31:30Z","updated_at":"2017-06-28T11:16:21Z","closed_at":"2016-04-26T13:18:30Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I am currently developing an application that is supposed to download a few MP4 videos and play them in an endless loop.\n\nWhile everything works perfectly when I run the app on my phone (LG G2 with KitKat) I experience a strange problem on the intended device, which is a screenless Android box that shows up as \"Unknown SoftwinerEvb\" in Android Studio. It is running Android 4.2.2.\n\nThe problem now is that on this specific device ExoPlayer does not send a STATE_FINISHED signal when the video ends. I rely on that signal to clean up that instance of ExoPlayer and move on to the next content item.\n\nFrom the logs it seems that everything is OK, all the other events (STATE_PREPARING, STATE_READY, etc.) are delivered without a problem.\n\nOccasionally, I see messages like the following in the logs:\n\n```\nSystemClock: time going backwards: prev 7298066659940(ioctl) vs now 7298066604315(ioctl), tid=32607\nSystemClock: time going backwards: prev 7299786994940(ioctl) vs now 7299784280399(ioctl), tid=32607\nSystemClock: time going backwards: prev 7300675466109(ioctl) vs now 7300675465734(ioctl), tid=32521\nSystemClock: time going backwards: prev 7303400685776(ioctl) vs now 7303399587401(ioctl), tid=32607\n\n```\n\nbut they don't seem to directly coincide with the problem. I just mention them because they are the only thing unusual that came to my attention...\n\nAny ideas why the event is not sent?\n","closed_by":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1443/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/1443/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}